{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOListItemImage","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemImage","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" displays an image (square or wide)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Sizes","level":2,"text":"Sizes","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemImage\/Size","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" enum defines the available sizes:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".medium"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The default size, suited for standard list items.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".large","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A larger variant for increased visual prominence."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".extraLarge","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The largest variant, typically used for profile-like displays."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note:"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" When the image is embedded in a list item with small size","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(via ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftUI\/View\/misoListItemSize(_:)"},{"text":"), the icon is always rendered at its smallest